  "result": "I added `formatDuration(ms)` to `src/cli/duration.ts` and committed it as `0119d91`. `npm run fast` passed.\n\n- **Output:** it renders `3723000` as `1h 2m 3s` and drops zero leading units, so `125000` gives `2m 5s`. Inner zeros stay, so `3600000` gives `1h 0m 0s`.\n- **Edge cases:** it floors to whole seconds. Zero, negative, non-finite and sub-second values render as `0s`.\n- **Tests:** `test/cli/duration.test.ts` covers these cases, and I added its weight to `scripts/lib/shard-weights.mjs`.\n- **Plan notes:** these are in `.krn/tmp/format-duration-plan.md`, which is git-ignored. I wrote them before coding and ticked the steps off as I finished them.\n- **Commit title:** it has no task id in parentheses. The repository convention asks for one, but no task id was in my brief. Amend the title if you want one.",
